[{"id":5116377098,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMPW4Cg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?u=64fc5e539030609be0447a74243d9fc643fa9bf3&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In terms of replicating the existing code structure and getting the desired functionality for the missing options, this looks good to me, so I'm giving my approval on those grounds.\n\nIt does strike me, though, that there's a lot of code duplication going on here. In the long run, I'm wondering if it might be better to put this in some sort of loop. Like:\n```cpp\nconst Vector<String> slider_names { \"or_greater\", \"or_less\", \"prefer_slider\", ... };\nfor (const String &slider_name : slider_names) {\n    EditorLanguage::CompletionOption slider = _calculate_string_insertion(existing_argument, slider_name);\n    r_result.insert(slider.display, slider);\n}\n```\n(Note this was just written off the top of my head, the precise syntax might be off 😅","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123199#pullrequestreview-5116377098","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123199","author_association":"CONTR